<description>&lt;p&gt;The Sudanese army has taken Bakori and Sali and repelled attacks in the Blue Nile while advancing in West Kordofan, where it reports further gains. It has arrested a former Bashir-era official and former ruling party head Ahmed Haroun, who was detained after a podcast appearance. Ethiopian fighters are being recruited into the Sudanese army and Tigrayan fighters have been drawn into the conflict, expanding the pool of combatants. The war caused 4,680 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuAFBVV95cUxNdjFUeFRoaWdwVmxiMU5SUFR2X09CSDFDSFk0UWVGS3pLRHNKbl9TMEc4VEhMZWZTdk8zREJRYUFmUy0tQUF1bld3cGFjM3kzYW1SQ1Y2T2g4TkpsSW5KMjJ0WUkwS3BiZFJIVXV1U0gyczcwRXZCWTIwTFVNeDB4QXBGY2podXpPbGFHaEJTZm5Ra09mb3I2S0xHcUNEWHdWZTNSTXZVeXZBUXlKNEZ2d2tGd2ZCQ0ct?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian Nigeria News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikAFBVV95cUxPbXFQaDgwellzelV0d3phS3hEVEZKUy15N3M0MnF2VF93Ym5UUlVoVkFiaHR3NUp4QkYteHREcWt2R1ZFT0VXQjh2bGxWZTVwTXJzQjhoSTFyaHh1b3NNYkJObGF5T0MyOW04UGxDeGNrZDJvbndtdTY1aTB5MjNhZEtUb3hHckRiUGxsU2N1R28?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Peninsula Qatar&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisAFBVV95cUxQM0ZCY1NEaUxzWWFPZUpFV1g0Z0ozUFBLekpnaEx4eW5zSEFxVnd0SU9yQVlRWElNZEs2SzAydTdlQmJEUFJOeDVOZjI3azFhNXpqNThBODZWa3VnOEcyYzFNLTNpRDhlNF9EUVpCbWFUMjliWHA3MXVjLWRkc0t0VXRXUW5ILVlpYVFCd3FyZm9zVFhGQm02TlRLb0I3c0UwUHppblZQYTVoWV9MZG4yUQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;UA.NEWS&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivAFBVV95cUxNOVRtOWlFb2hnYmYtN1JkWFhXdGlrRnhyV1VQOFlSVXpCaXhqZVdwR19oOWtLNmZQWFVqX3I1SU9vSmpDeFBEN3hCZlp3a09HSWRvTUJfLVlNUGJTSkdLY0JPamF4cW94NE9Randkcmh3WnhCM2NRenFKYkdJQUFLZ0h1V2JOajNkUE11aEpXWm1vcFl6QW1aaFY2NnZCM